.idea/*
/data/OP1/Diagrams/
/data/OP1_centralized/

# P5.11 diagnostic template (~165 MB pickle) -- deliberately NOT committed.
# It is a reproducible build artefact, not primary evidence: its identity is
# recorded in data/SRP1/Results/P511/p511_selfconsistent_t0_meta.json
# (template_id, state_sha256, file_sha256, config_hash) and it is regenerated by
#   python p511_1_selfconsistent_t0.py build
# Committing it would need Git LFS or another approved artifact store; until one
# is chosen, this entry keeps it out of the index.
data/SRP1/Results/P511/*.pkl

# Editor / OS / interpreter noise. Kept out so that `git status` stays short:
# the investigation's integrity gates read tracked state and untracked listings,
# and drift is far easier to review against a short list than a long one.
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Stray solver logs written to the repository root by relative output_file
# settings (ESSO uses optim_log_node_<id>.txt; IPOPT writes ipopt.log).
/ipopt.log
/optim_log*.txt
/p57_d1_chain_studio.log
manuscript/
